<title>SOUTH KOREA: Seyang Shipping limit low on Hanbo news.</title>
<headline>Seyang Shipping limit low on Hanbo news.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The shares of South Korean Seyang Shipping Co Ltd fell sharply in Friday morning trading on fears that the shipping firm would be badly affected by the default of Hanbo Steel Corp.</p>
<p>The shares fell 800 won to their lower limit of 9,200.</p>
<p>Analysts said the two companies have no direct financial connection.</p>
</text>
